    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an intelligent assistance tool capable of accompanying agents in agents administrative activities (con:con2), searching for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation (con:con3), providing help with drafting letters or answers to users (con:con4), and suggesting actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process (con:con6)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide times of response compatible with daily use (con:con22) and guarantee a high level of availability (con:con24)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design the AI components to meet these requirements, and what innovation strategy should we propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements for an intelligent assistance tool, we can leverage we expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned on the client's internal procedures, applicable regulations, and administrative processes to provide accurate and relevant information. we can design a RAG-based system that incorporates we retrieval strategies, such as dense vector semantic search or hybrid approaches, to quickly find relevant information within the client's knowledge base." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, to provide timely responses, meeting the daily use requirement (con:con22)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure high availability (con:con24), we can deploy Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, on a cloud-based infrastructure with adequate redundancy and failover mechanisms. we experience with open-source contributions, such as LangChain plugins and RAG evaluation toolkit, can also be leveraged to develop a scalable and maintainable solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting letters or answers to users (con:con4), we LLM expertise can be applied to generate human-like text based on the context and input provided. we can also utilize we knowledge of explainability methods, such as source citation and chain-of-thought display, to provide transparent and trustworthy suggestions for actions or steps to realize in administrative processes (con:con6)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, we propose focusing on the development of a modular and adaptable architecture that can be easily integrated with the client's existing systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable we to iteratively refine and improve the solution based on user feedback and performance metrics. we current research topics, such as knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks, can also be explored to further enhance Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, capabilities and provide a competitive edge." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By adopting an agile development approach and engaging with the client through regular feedback sessions, we can ensure that the solution meets the client evolving needs and priorities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit environmental footprint (con:con37), reduce energetic consumption (con:con38), and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact (con:con39)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must propose a contribution to the reduction of energetic consumption and take into account environmental issues." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainability posture should we adopt, and how can we contribute to reducing the client's environmental footprint?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's concerns about limiting environmental footprint, reducing energetic consumption, and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., can adopt a sustainability posture that leverages our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing capabilities.  our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can propose hosting solutions through our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, both of which are located in France and use 100% renewable energy. propose not only reduces the carbon footprint associated with hosting but also ensures compliance with high environmental standards, as our green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, both of which are located in France and use 100% renewable energy are ISO14001 certified." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can implement digital sobriety practices that contribute to reducing energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, using INT8/INT4 model quantisation can reduce GPU energy by approximately 40%, and auto-scaling to zero outside business hours can significantly minimize unnecessary energy use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, query result caching is estimated to reduce recomputations by about 20%, further decreasing energy consumption. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green IT hardware procurement policy, which ensures a minimum 5-year lifecycle for hardware, also supports reducing electronic waste and the environmental impacts associated with frequent hardware replacements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By adopting these measures, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can contribute to the reduction of the client's environmental footprint while ensuring that our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. solutions are aligned with our solutions sustainability goals. our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. carbon reporting capability, based on GRI Standards (partial), will enable our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. to monitor and report on the carbon impact of our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. operations, providing transparency and accountability in our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. sustainability efforts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, by combining green hosting, digital sobriety practices, responsible hardware procurement, and transparent carbon reporting, our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can offer a comprehensive sustainability posture that supports the client's objectives of minimizing environmental footprint and reducing energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a duration of 4 years (con:con35), and the deployment will be conducted in a progressive manner with a pilot phase on a limited scope (con:con40, con:con41) followed by a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services (con:con42)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires accompaniment to change and training for agents (req:req61)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How should we coordinate The project to ensure successful delivery, and what are the key milestones and risks?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To coordinate The project and ensure successful delivery, we will follow we typical delivery structure which includes phases such as Inception & Design, Pilot / MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's requirement for accompaniment to change and training for agents, we will also dedicate a change manager to oversee this process, utilizing we training delivery capabilities including in-person workshops, e-learning, and quick reference guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
